<https://w3id.org/ontometal#> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "This ontology is designed to represent the domain of metal music, including bands, albums, releases, and related concepts. It provides a structured framework for organizing and linking information about metal music entities." .
